<title>USA: AMEX to list MasTec Inc options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list MasTec Inc options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list options on MasTec Inc shares on Tuesday, February 25.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 60, 65 and 70, with expirations in March, April, July and October, the exchange said. Position limit is 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Group One Trading LP will be the specialist unit on the AMEX floor.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk 312-408-8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
